From 52537a05c3ca7648a538fcd1de8e4e5634b3f5c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Liang Kaiwen <liangkaiwen24@mails.ucas.ac.cn>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:57:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sched/chimera: add layered automatic migration with proposal/ACK

Implement layered assignment, source-side proposals and generation-bound ACK commits. Track pending allocations and CPU reservations across fork, exec, exit and scheduler transitions.

Source-Commit: 52537a05c3ca7648a538fcd1de8e4e5634b3f5c5

